                                                        <p class="brfprofile">

                                                            <b>Brief Profile:</b><br>

                                                            Prof. Ranu Srivastava, an accomplished alumna of IIM Trichy,
                                                            brings over 15+ years of rich and diverse experience across
                                                            corporate and academic sectors. She is currently pursuing
                                                            her Ph.D. as a Research Scholar in Human Resources, further
                                                            strengthening her academic and research expertise in the
                                                            field.<br>
                                                            A Microsoft AI-certified professional and an HRCI &
                                                            SPHR-certified trainer, she has an extensive background in
                                                            Learning and Development, where she has successfully led
                                                            strategic initiatives to enhance organizational growth and
                                                            individual capability building.<br>
                                                            She holds a postgraduate degree in General Management from
                                                            IIM Trichy and a graduate degree in Industrial Microbiology
                                                            from Maharani College, Rajasthan University. Prof.
                                                            Srivastava is widely recognized for her ability to design
                                                            and deliver impactful training programs that drive
                                                            performance and foster a culture of continuous learning.
                                                            Over the course of her career, she has successfully trained
                                                            and mentored 4,000+ students across diverse programs
                                                            including PGDM, MBA, B.Tech, M.Tech, and Hospitality,
                                                            enabling them to become industry-ready professionals. Her
                                                            efforts have also contributed significantly to achieving
                                                            strong placement outcomes in reputed organizations.
                                                            A seasoned professional specializing in AI-driven training
                                                            solutions, her expertise spans soft skills development,
                                                            aptitude training, resume crafting and interview defense,
                                                            group discussions, public speaking, and confidence building.
                                                            She has a proven track record of designing high-impact
                                                            initiatives that accelerate placement readiness and holistic
                                                            capability development in both academic and corporate
                                                            environments.<br>
                                                            Prof. Srivastava is deeply passionate about talent
                                                            management, leadership development, and personality
                                                            enhancement through structured, industry-aligned programs.
                                                            She is also a certified POSH (Prevention of Sexual
                                                            Harassment) trainer, delivering sensitization and compliance
                                                            workshops across academic institutions and corporate
                                                            organizations.<br>
                                                            In addition to her academic contributions, she is a
                                                            respected life coach and expert speaker who actively shares
                                                            her insights through webinars, workshops, and professional
                                                            platforms.



                                                        </p>

